@*
============================================================================
AUTHOR:       Cole Howell, Michael Hudgins
COURSE:       ISTM 415
PROGRAM:      _ViewStart.cshtml

PURPOSE:      Specifies the default layout page used by all Razor views
              within the application.

INPUT:        N/A

PROCESS:      Assigns the shared layout file (_Layout.cshtml) to the Layout
              property so that all views inherit a consistent structure.

OUTPUT:       Ensures all views render using the common layout, including
              header, navigation bar, and footer.

HONOR CODE:   On my honor, as an Aggie, I have neither given nor received
              unauthorized aid on this academic work.
============================================================================
*@

@{
    @* Set the default layout for all views *@
    Layout = "_Layout";
}
